<font size=2>投稿者：<font color=0000FF><b>Bancho</b></font>　投稿日：2001/08/15(Wed) 21:26:47</font><br><font color=0000FF><font color=#000000></font>おーるろーるでGO！<br><font color=DimGray> **A Magic Die 0 to 1000. turned up <b><font color=#000000>682</font></b>.</font><br>紫さんには勝つぞ！</font></td></tr></table></div>
<div align=center><table border=0 width=95% cellspacing=1 cellpadding=5>
