<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="800000"><br>大変遅くなってすまんですm(__)m<br><br>微妙な物も混ざってますが振ってください<br>1番は装備する人でLotto指定で<br><br>その他はLotto指定無しで振ってもらって<br>上位から選んでもらって分配を予定<br>期限は27日まで<br><br>1.Imbued Grantle Spauldors（重いけど凄い性能）<br>MAGIC LORE<br>SHOULDERS<br>AC:20<br>SV FIRE: +10,SV DISEASE: +10,SV COLD: +10<br>SV MAGIC: +10,SV POISON: +10<br>WT:19.4 SIZE:SMALL<br>CLASS:WAR CLR PAL RNG SHD MNK BRD SHM<br>RACE:HUM BAR ERU ELF HIE DEF HEF<br><br>2.Loam Encrusted Lined Shoes（Enc向き？） <br>MAGIC ITEM LORE ITEM<br>Stats: AC: 4 - Wt: 0.7 - Slot: feet<br>Attributes: DEX+8 AGI+8 CHA+8 MANA+15 SV POISON+10 <br>Class: NEC WIZ MAG ENC <br>Race: HUM ERU HIE DEF GNM IKS<br><br>3.Earthshaker　（重くて遅いらしい剣、２個）<br>MAGIC ITEM LORE ITEM<br>DMG: 37 DLY: 70 DPS: 10.71 <br>Boosts +6 STR, -5 DEX, +6 STA <br>Effect Earthquake <br>Weight & Size WT: 16.0 Size: GIANT <br>Class WAR, PAL, RNG, SHD <br>Race ALL<br><br>4.Smoldering Brand　（いつもの松明、２個）<br>Magicitem Lore item<br>Slot:Primary Secondary<br>Skill:1H Brant Delay:22<br>DMG:9<br>STR:+3<br>Effect:Burn<br>WT:5.0 Size:Small<br>Class:All<br>Race:All<br><br>5.Elemental binder（欲しい人居るのか？ｗ）<br>LORE ITEM MAGIC ITEM <br>AC: +5 Int: +5 Fire Resist: +5 Cold Resist: +5 <br>Weight: 8.0 <br>Classes: Magician <br>Races: All Races <br>Inventory Slot: Head</font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
